\label{lem:derivative-v}
Let $f\in{\tt{C}}([0,T])$ satisfies $f(t)> 0$ for all $t\in[0,T]$. We have $v\in{{\tt{C}}}^{1,2,2}(\overline{\mathcal{D}}_T)$ and $v_r\in$ ${{\tt{C}}}^{1,2,2}(\overline{\mathcal{D}}_T)$. Moreover, for $(t, r, h) \in\overline{\mathcal{D}}_T$, we get
